{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "RunGetData",
  "description": "`run.get`'s reply: one run, durably: its state, structured output and end survive an\nrlxd restart.",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "attempt": {
      "description": "Its attempt, from 1.",
      "type": "integer",
      "format": "uint64",
      "maximum": 18446744073709551615,
      "minimum": 1
    },
    "calls": {
      "description": "Every gated call's ledger record (5.1).",
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/RunCall"
      }
    },
    "client": {
      "description": "The `client` of the connection that started it.",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "ended_at": {
      "description": "When it last ended, if it has: `finished_at` too.",
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time"
    },
    "finished_at": {
      "description": "When it last ended, if it has (the hub's name for `ended_at`).",
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time"
    },
    "job_id": {
      "description": "The scheduler job that fired it.",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "kind": {
      "description": "Its kind.",
      "$ref": "#/$defs/RunKind"
    },
    "last_event": {
      "description": "Its last event, as the stream carried it.",
      "$ref": "#/$defs/Event"
    },
    "last_run_seq": {
      "description": "Its last event's `run_seq`, 0 before its first.",
      "type": "integer",
      "format": "uint64",
      "maximum": 18446744073709551615,
      "minimum": 0
    },
    "run_id": {
      "description": "The run.",
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
    },
    "session": {
      "description": "The session to resume, or `null` for a session-less run or one not done yet.",
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "space": {
      "description": "Its space.",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "started_at": {
      "description": "When `run.start` took it.",
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time"
    },
    "state": {
      "description": "Its state now.",
      "$ref": "#/$defs/RunState"
    },
    "structured_output": {
      "description": "Its structured output, once it has one."
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "run_id",
    "kind",
    "state",
    "attempt",
    "space",
    "client",
    "started_at",
    "last_run_seq",
    "calls"
  ],
  "$defs": {
    "CallState": {
      "description": "A gated call's ledger state (5.1).",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "description": "Decided, and not allowed to run.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "decided"
        },
        {
          "description": "Allowed, and running.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "executing"
        },
        {
          "description": "It ran and succeeded: sent.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "ok"
        },
        {
          "description": "It ran and failed: not sent.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "error"
        },
        {
          "description": "It was running when its run ended: it may have sent.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "unknown"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Event": {
      "title": "Event",
      "description": "One event on the stream `events.subscribe` opens.\n\n```json\n{\"schema_version\": 1, \"seq\": 42, \"time\": \"2026-11-25T12:00:00.000Z\", \"topic\": \"run\",\n \"type\": \"run.text\", \"data\": {\"run_id\": \"…\", \"run_seq\": 3, \"kind\": \"task\", \"attempt\": 1}}\n```\n\nTwo sequences number events. `seq` is per home: every event has one, and\n`events.subscribe {since}` resumes after it. `data.run_seq` is per run: every event\nwhose topic is `run` has one, with the run's `run_id`, `kind`, `attempt` and\n`job_id?`, so a client can replay one run from a known point.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "data": {
          "description": "The type's own fields. On the `run` topic, also `run_id`, `run_seq`, `kind`,\n`attempt` and `job_id?`.",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true
        },
        "schema_version": {
          "description": "The schema version this document follows.",
          "type": "integer",
          "const": 1
        },
        "seq": {
          "description": "Strictly increasing per home, from 1, across every topic. `events.subscribe\n{since}` resumes after it.",
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "uint64",
          "maximum": 18446744073709551615,
          "minimum": 1
        },
        "time": {
          "description": "When it happened: RFC 3339, in UTC, to the millisecond (`2026-11-25T12:00:00.000Z`).",
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        "topic": {
          "description": "What it is about, in snake_case, such as `run` or `needs_you`. A client ignores\ntopics it does not know.",
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$"
        },
        "type": {
          "description": "What happened: `<topic>.<event>`, the event in snake_case, such as `run.text`,\n`fleet.agent_spawned` or `connector.login.open_url`. It starts with this event's\nown topic. A client ignores types it does not know.",
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)+$"
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "daemon"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "pattern": "^daemon\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "run"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "pattern": "^run\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "job"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "pattern": "^job\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "connector"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "pattern": "^connector\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "pty"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "pattern": "^pty\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "hook"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "pattern": "^hook\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "fleet"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "pattern": "^fleet\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "board"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "pattern": "^board\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "needs_you"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "pattern": "^needs_you\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "upgrade"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "pattern": "^upgrade\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "settings"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "pattern": "^settings\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "install"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "pattern": "^install\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "signin"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "pattern": "^signin\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "const": "run"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "topic"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "data": {
                "properties": {
                  "attempt": {
                    "description": "Which attempt of the run, from 1.",
                    "type": "integer",
                    "maximum": 18446744073709551615,
                    "minimum": 1
                  },
                  "job_id": {
                    "description": "The scheduler job that fired the run, if one did.",
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "kind": {
                    "description": "The run's kind, such as task or widget_refresh.",
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "run_id": {
                    "description": "The run this event belongs to.",
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "run_seq": {
                    "description": "Strictly increasing per run, from 1.",
                    "type": "integer",
                    "maximum": 18446744073709551615,
                    "minimum": 1
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "run_id",
                  "run_seq",
                  "kind",
                  "attempt"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "required": [
        "schema_version",
        "seq",
        "time",
        "topic",
        "type",
        "data"
      ]
    },
    "RunCall": {
      "description": "One gated call of a run (5.1): what `run.get` tells the app about a send.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "by": {
          "description": "Who decided: `app`, `rlxd`, `timeout` or `unreachable`.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "call_id": {
          "description": "Claude Code's `tool_use_id`.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "decision": {
          "description": "`allow`, `deny` or `draft`.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "input_sha256": {
          "description": "The SHA-256 of the call's input as RFC 8785 JSON.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "state": {
          "description": "Where it stands.",
          "$ref": "#/$defs/CallState"
        },
        "tool": {
          "description": "The tool.",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "call_id",
        "tool",
        "input_sha256",
        "state"
      ]
    },
    "RunKind": {
      "description": "What a run is for (7.5). Each kind has its own pool, and rlxd's gate rules for it\n(5.1).",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "description": "A task the user asked for. The only kind whose session persists by default.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "task"
        },
        {
          "description": "Sends one pinned call. Never resumed: a send is never retried.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "send_executor"
        },
        {
          "description": "Refreshes a widget's data.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "widget_refresh"
        },
        {
          "description": "One pinned read call for a scheduled watch.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "watch"
        },
        {
          "description": "rlxapp's send-time `Check`: no tools.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "check"
        },
        {
          "description": "Parses an instruction: no tools.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "parse_instruction"
        },
        {
          "description": "Writes a widget: no tools.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "widget_author"
        }
      ]
    },
    "RunState": {
      "description": "Where a run stands (7.5).",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "description": "Waiting for a place in its kind's pool.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "queued"
        },
        {
          "description": "Its Claude Code is running.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "running"
        },
        {
          "description": "It ended needing the user; `run.resume` goes on with it.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "needs_you"
        },
        {
          "description": "It ended with a result.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "done"
        },
        {
          "description": "It ended without one: `run.failed`'s `reason` says why.",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "failed"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
